  {
   "id": "before-exit-supermarket-309836@post-2025-10-16",
   "gameId": "before-exit-supermarket-309836",
   "displayName": "Achievements Are (Finally) Fixed!",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "inferred",
   "announcedAt": "2025-10-16T13:46:19.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Hello Everyone!",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "After the release of the sequel, we had this strange feeling that we’d forgotten something important... and yes, it was Supermarket all along!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Some of you reported this bug a long time ago, but in the madness of developing Gas Station, we never had time to properly address it - until today!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Today’s patch notes are short, but it’s something many of you have been asking for:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "- Fixed a bug that prevented players from collecting achievements",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "We want to thank every player who reported that issue initially: @Raytenecks, @Swinetower, @CitizenX3639, and @flaviopaganinijr from this discussion thread <3",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "What else?",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Last week, we released Before Exit: Gas Station - the next installment in the series! It’s directly connected to the Supermarket, so you’ll feel right at home there!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[dynamiclink href=\"https://store.steampowered.com/app/3268520/Before_Exit_Gas_Station/\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "If you already own Before Exit: Supermarket, you can complete your collection and grab the bundle with both games at a discount!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[dynamiclink href=\"https://store.steampowered.com/bundle/60664/Before_Exit_Supermarket__Gas_Station/\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Before Exit: Supermarket is now available on Steam at its lowest price ever!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "[dynamiclink href=\"https://store.steampowered.com/app/2983730/Before_Exit_Supermarket/\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Till the next one 🫡",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45055880/e0a8d4ad40afeba9a19a0b1a968f5d003f2024ba.png\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
